# Test files

Vitest files are `*.test.ts` in `test/unit` or `test/integration`.

- UI tests start with `// @vitest-environment jsdom`.
- Server tests use the default Node environment.

Playwright specs are `test/e2e/*.spec.ts`. Page classes are `test/e2e/pages/`. Plans are `test/e2e/*.plan.md`.

- Locators live on the page object. Prefer `getByRole`.
- Assertions live in the spec.
